  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, an acupuncturist gains a pool of ki points, supernatural energy they can use to accomplish amazing feats. The number of points in an acupuncturist’s ki pool is equal to 1/2 their acupuncturist level + their Intelligence modifier.</p>\n<p>At 3rd level an acupuncturist can spend 1 ki point after making a successful acupuncture strike to increase the duration of its de qi effect from 1 round to a number of rounds equal to their Intelligence modifier.</p>\n<p>An acupuncturist gains additional powers that consume points from their ki pool as they gain levels. The ki pool is replenished each morning after 8 hours of rest or meditation; these hours do not need to be consecutive.</p>\n<h4>Sidebar: Multiple Ki Pools</h4>\n<p>If the acupuncturist gains a ki pool from a separate source, levels in ki granting classes stack for the purpose of determining the size of their ki pool but only one modifier would apply to it. (Example: An acupuncturist 8 / monk 8 would have an effective level of 16 but would have to pick either Wisdom or Intelligence as the basis for their ki pool.)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/acupuncturist-class#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
